    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上期咱们聊完了备婚过程中关于</span><strong><span>酒店</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>婚庆</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>四大金刚</span></strong><span>的选择，今天我们主要来聊聊</span><strong><span>婚纱照</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>婚服</span></strong><span>准备的注意事项~</span></p><span></span><p><span>|内容介绍|</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">0:38</a> 婚纱照怎么选？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2088">34:48</a> 婚纱挑哪些？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2479">41:19</a> 婚鞋怎么买？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2748">45:48</a> 伴郎伴娘服如何备？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2718">45:18</a> 新郎全套装备如何搞？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果大家有什么好的想法或建议，欢迎给我们留言啦~</span></p>]]></description>
