  <item>
    <title>Vol.03 天津（下）与众不同的天津风俗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62c144baffa3b62fed6a9c60</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62c144baffa3b62fed6a9c60</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Jul 2022 07:26:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上期聊完了天津的美食文化，今天我们来叙说</span><strong><span>天津</span></strong><span>的风俗和特色景点~</span></p><span></span><p><span>|内容介绍|</span></p><span></span><h2><span>习俗：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a></span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 腊八儿：腊八粥、腊八醋缘起何日？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 贴吊钱+贴肥猪：吊钱肥猪能上窗上门？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 大年三十和大年初一：融合南北方新春习俗的大年三十和初一是何面目？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a> 姑爷节：姑爷也过节？回婆家还是回娘家？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a> 破五：除小人才能迎大吉？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>景点 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1605">26:45</a></span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> 海河景：天津的发源，最美天津之地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> 古文化街：探“熟梨糕，笼嘴大铜壶，泥人，杨柳青年画，天后宫，相声”</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果大家有什么好的想法或建议，欢迎给我们留言啦~</span></p>]]></description>
