  <item>
    <title>Vol.02 天津！哏都？吃货的天堂？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62b7d7f2c71db0c038b7af90</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62b7d7f2c71db0c038b7af90</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jun 2022 03:52:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><br></h2><span></span><p><span>我们本站来到</span><strong><span>天津</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>”竹板这么一打，别的咱别夸，夸一夸咱天津卫是何等出众哒~“</span></p><span></span><p><span>天津是人人都会说相声吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>天津为什么从早上6点开始就能让你爱上？</span></p><span></span><p><span>天津三绝如何“绝”的呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对这个最适宜人居住的城市有着好奇，那就听我们娓娓道来~</span></p><span></span><p><span>|内容介绍|</span></p><span></span><h2><span>早餐 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a></span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 煎饼果子：里面有“果子”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 锅巴菜：天津话怎么读？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 面茶：非面非茶的美味</span></p><span></span><h2><span>天津三绝 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a></span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 狗不理：如何成为天津三绝之首的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 耳朵眼炸糕：为啥叫“耳朵眼”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a> 十八街麻花：天津人认总店，那总店在哪？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果大家有什么好的想法或建议，欢迎大家给我们留言啦~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu3z0bIj-TsS8LiGhmRxTgTuMa2x.m4a" length="65738708" type="audio/mp4"/>
