  <item>
    <title>Vol.01 吃了就能赛神仙？烟台人的最爱？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62adc78af21b8abc99f65f62</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62adc78af21b8abc99f65f62</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 18 Jun 2022 12:39:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们首站来到</span><strong><span>烟台</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这个宁静的海边城市，人们或漫步海边，让温柔的海风拂去繁杂的压力，静静体会岁月的平静与美好；</span></p><span></span><p><span>或找一个海鲜大排档，大快朵颐，徜徉在鲜味的世界里，细享美食的盛宴；</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲爱的朋友们，想感受他们的生活吗？如果你感兴趣的话就请戴上耳机，和我们的“吃喝玩乐团”一起出发，领略声音带来的听觉享受吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>|内容介绍|</span></p><span></span><h2><span>早餐 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">1:06</a></span></h2><span></span><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">1:28</a></span></u><span> 豆腐脑：现代的豆腐脑竟能追溯到汉武帝时期？</span></p><span></span><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">6:04</a></span></u><span> 油条：油条也叫油炸桧？炸秦桧？</span></p><span></span><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="663">11:03</a></span></u><span> 疙瘩汤：吕洞宾也爱吃疙瘩汤？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>特色海鲜 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a></span></h2><span></span><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="992">16:32</a></span></u><span> 海肠：海肠之鲜胜过味精？海肠何以让人念念不忘？</span></p><span></span><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1552">25:52</a></span></u><span> 生蚝：何等美味竟让大文豪苏东坡不肯与外人分享？</span></p><span></span><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2443">40:43</a></span></u><span> 海参：铁拐李得道升天的秘密</span></p><span></span><h2><span>特色水果 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2817">46:57</a></span></h2><span></span><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a></span></u><span> 苹果：红富士到底应该是什么味道的？</span></p><span></span><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2900">48:20</a></span></u><span> 樱桃：如何在PK车厘子中完胜</span></p><span></span><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2985">49:45</a></span></u><span> 梨：怎么吃最治嗓子？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>景点 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3105">51:45</a></span></h2><span></span><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3110">51:50</a></span></u><span> 张裕：葡萄酒的前世今生</span></p><span></span><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3550">59:10</a></span></u><span> 蓬莱阁：来蓬莱仙境去邂逅八仙</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果大家有什么好的想法或者建议，欢迎大家给我们留言啦~</span></p>]]></description>
